# Anchored patterns only.
#
# `package.json` now has a `files` allowlist, so this file no longer decides what
# ships in the npx/npm tarball. Keep the patterns anchored anyway: an unanchored
# pattern like `.claude/` would also match `templates/claude/.claude/**` and quietly
# drop the entire Claude adapter from the install.

/node_modules/
/.playwright/
/.homero-worktrees/

# Local AI-client state (never part of the harness Homero installs)
/.claude/settings.local.json

# Real MCP server config (Figma tokens etc.) — copy from templates/core/mcp.example.json
/.mcp.json

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
*.log
